          "content": "# PHẦN 3 — VOCABULARY B2 THEO CHỦ ĐỀ CHUẨN VSTEP (CHỦ ĐỀ 01 - 05)\n\nQuy trình chuẩn hóa từ vựng học thuật B2:\nVocabulary (Từ loại + IPA + Nghĩa) -> Collocations -> Word Family -> Synonyms / Antonyms -> Câu ví dụ B2 -> Ứng dụng Speaking & Writing.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 01: EDUCATION & TRAINING (GIÁO DỤC & ĐÀO TẠO)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ học thuật cốt lõi: curriculum, pedagogical, tertiary, vocational, literacy, autonomy, matriculate, academic rigor, rote learning, continuous assessment, tuition fees, holistic development, merit-based scholarship, compulsory education, plagiarism, discipline, faculty members, university alumni, remedial education, interdisciplinary research, standardized tests, critical thinking skills, interactive pedagogy, academic credentials, dissertation, extracurricular activities, dropout rate, asynchronous learning, linguistic competence, enrichment programs, instill moral values, accreditation, undergraduate, inquisitive mind, subsidize higher education.\n- Ví dụ B2: The integration of interdisciplinary curricula enables undergraduates to synthesize scientific methodologies with humanitarian ethics.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Continuous assessment relieves standardized exam anxiety.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Subsidizing tertiary education dismantles intergenerational poverty.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 02: WORK & CAREER (VIỆC LÀM & NGHỀ NGHIỆP)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: employability skills, remuneration, telecommute, occupational burnout, corporate ladder, glass ceiling, workforce productivity, compulsory redundancy, financial incentives, white-collar professions, blue-collar workforce, probationary period, fringe benefits / perks, workplace absenteeism, job satisfaction, flexible working arrangements, performance appraisal, turnover rate, freelance contractor, meritocracy, nepotism, staff retention, upskill the workforce, severance package, work ethic, core competencies, delegate authority, subordinate staff, demote, work-life balance, international counterparts, corporate downsizing, lucrative career, vocation, psychological resilience.\n- Ví dụ B2: In an increasingly automated marketplace, professionals must continuously upskill to preserve their occupational employability.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Balancing lucrative remuneration with work-life equilibrium.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 1/2: Demonstrating core competencies and high workplace productivity.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 03: TECHNOLOGY & INNOVATION (CÔNG NGHỆ & ĐỔI MỚI)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: cutting-edge technology, obsolete, revolutionize, breakthrough, ubiquitous, cybersecurity, technical glitch, user-friendly interface, autonomous navigation, digitalize operations, telecommunication infrastructure, disruptive innovation, software compatibility, smart gadgets, biometric sensors, patent infringement, high-speed broadband, mechanical malfunction, virtual reality (VR), augmented reality (AR), cloud computing, end-to-end encryption, telecommunication, tech-savvy consumers, biometric authentication, miniaturize microchips, upgrade server capacity, streamline administrative procedures, network bandwidth, planned obsolescence, graphical interface, e-commerce, facial surveillance, telemedicine, pioneer renewable technologies.\n- Ví dụ B2: The emergence of disruptive technologies has systematically rendered legacy systems obsolete, compelling enterprises to digitalize their core infrastructure.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Daily utilization of cloud computing and smart gadgets.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Telemedicine and cloud platforms revolutionize institutional efficiency.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 04: ARTIFICIAL INTELLIGENCE (TRÍ TUỆ NHÂN TẠO - AI)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: algorithmic model, industrial automation, neural network, generative AI, machine learning, deep learning, algorithmic bias, ethical dilemma, computational power, natural language processing (NLP), predictive modeling, AI hallucination, virtual assistant, cognitive faculty, autonomous decision-making, displace labor, plausible fabrication, unsupervised learning, sentiment analysis, intellectual property, anthropomorphic avatar, hyper-realistic deepfake, malicious disinformation, unprecedented expansion, algorithmic transparency, black-box model, supervise training, algorithmic heuristics, curate datasets, technological singularity, copyright infringement, surpass human benchmarks, replicate human reasoning, regulatory safeguards, ethical governance.\n- Ví dụ B2: While automation enhances organizational productivity, it threatens to displace substantial segments of both manual and cognitive workforces.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Tailored predictive learning versus risks of generative reliance.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Algorithmic transparency and mandatory workforce reskilling.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 05: ENVIRONMENT & ECOSYSTEMS (MÔI TRƯỜNG & HỆ SINH THÁI)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: biodiversity, wildlife conservation, fragile ecosystem, environmental degradation, tropical deforestation, endangered species, industrial pollutant, flora and fauna, sustainable development, ecological footprint, illicit poaching, resource depletion, groundwater contamination, afforestation campaigns, environmental stewardship, habitat loss, threat of extinction, wildlife sanctuary, untreated effluent discharge, biodegradable packaging, municipal landfill, overfishing, marine conservation, biosphere reserves, ecological equilibrium, soil erosion, toxic waste disposal, indigenous species, invasive alien species, ecological imperative, mitigate emissions, carbon footprint, renewable resources, oil spill, curtail dumping.\n- Ví dụ B2: The rampant conversion of pristine forests into monoculture plantations has precipitated catastrophic habitat loss, pushing numerous endangered species to the verge of extinction.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Reducing personal ecological footprint with biodegradable alternatives.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: State-financed afforestation campaigns and strict industrial effluent regulations.\n"
