          "content": "# PHẦN 3 — VOCABULARY B2 THEO CHỦ ĐỀ CHUẨN VSTEP (CHỦ ĐỀ 06 - 10)\n\nHệ thống từ vựng học thuật B2 được biên soạn theo chu trình:\nVocabulary (Từ loại + IPA + Nghĩa) -> Collocations -> Word Family -> Synonyms / Antonyms -> Câu ví dụ B2 -> Ứng dụng Speaking & Writing.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 06: CLIMATE CHANGE & GLOBAL WARMING (BIẾN ĐỔI KHÍ HẬU)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: greenhouse effect, global warming, carbon emission, fossil fuel, renewable energy, solar panel, wind turbine, catastrophic, weather extreme, sea level rise, glacier melting, greenhouse gas, carbon tax, net zero, decarbonization, mitigation, adaptation, climate refugee, desertification, drought, flash flood, torrential rain, atmospheric, carbon footprint, ecological tipping point, vulnerability, fossil-fuel reliance, environmental degradation, ozone layer, catastrophe, carbon sequestration, sustainable lifestyle, global consensus, climate summit, unprecedented heatwave.\n- Ví dụ B2: The irreversible acceleration of atmospheric greenhouse gas concentrations threatens to breach catastrophic ecological tipping points.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Extreme weather anomalies and personal carbon footprint reduction.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Implementing carbon taxation and international emission treaties.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 07: HEALTH, HEALTHCARE & MENTAL WELL-BEING (SỨC KHỎE & Y TẾ)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: universal healthcare, preventative medicine, chronic illness, mental well-being, sedentary lifestyle, obesity epidemic, balanced diet, cardiovascular disease, infectious disease, epidemic, pandemic, immunization, diagnostic tool, mortality rate, life expectancy, psychiatric disorder, stress management, anxiety, depression, clinical trial, prescription medication, telemedicine, wellness, cognitive health, physical fitness, nutrition, processed food, healthcare expenditure, vulnerable demographic, sanitation, hygiene, palliative care, holistic health, psychological resilience, curb disease transmission.\n- Ví dụ B2: Transitioning from reactive treatment toward preventative healthcare decisively alleviates national expenditure on chronic cardiovascular ailments.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Maintaining mental equilibrium and physical fitness amidst academic pressure.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Subsidizing universal healthcare versus private health insurance.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 08: SOCIETY, DEMOGRAPHICS & SOCIAL INEQUALITIES (XÃ HỘI & BẤT BÌNH ĐẲNG)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: demographic shift, aging population, social inequality, wealth gap, poverty alleviation, marginalized community, social mobility, welfare system, affirmative action, discrimination, gender disparity, social cohesion, civil liberties, juvenile delinquency, public infrastructure, gentrification, social safety net, civic responsibility, civic engagement, social stratification, socioeconomic divide, inclusivity, underprivileged, humanitarian aid, demographic crisis, birth rate, labor shortage, pension deficit, social unrest, human rights, egalitarian, social welfare, integration, societal well-being, equal opportunity.\n- Ví dụ B2: The widening wealth gap threatens social cohesion, compelling governments to reinforce social safety nets and progressive taxation.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Societal impacts of population aging on municipal services.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Strategies for poverty alleviation and equitable wealth distribution.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 09: FAMILY STRUCTURES & PARENTING DYNAMICS (GIA ĐÌNH & NUÔI DẠY CON)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: nuclear family, extended family, single-parent household, multigenerational living, parenting style, authoritarian, authoritative, permissive, helicopter parenting, child rearing, nurture, nature versus nurture, parental guidance, generational gap, filial piety, domestic chores, work-family balance, formative years, moral upbringing, emotional support, adolescent rebellion, sibling rivalry, family cohesion, maternal leave, paternal leave, breadwinner, caregiver, domestic violence, neglect, juvenile, instill values, parental involvement, social conditioning, family bonding, eldercare.\n- Ví dụ B2: Authoritative parenting styles foster emotional resilience and academic autonomy in children during their formative years.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Advantages and drawbacks of multigenerational households.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Impact of dual-income families on child emotional development.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 10: RELATIONSHIPS & SOCIAL NETWORKS (MỐI QUAN HỆ & MẠNG LƯỚI XÃ HỘI)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: interpersonal skills, emotional intelligence, empathy, mutual trust, camaraderie, peer pressure, alienation, social isolation, networking, professional rapport, conflict resolution, intimate relationship, platonic friendship, social circle, social dynamics, compromise, communication breakdown, ostracize, solidarity, sociability, extrovert, introvert, digital interaction, face-to-face interaction, superficial connection, genuine bond, reciprocal, altruism, social anxiety, companionship, mutual respect, constructive feedback, reconcile, estrangement, social fabric.\n- Ví dụ B2: Although social media platforms facilitate instantaneous networking, they often foster superficial interactions at the expense of profound emotional bonds.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Overcoming peer pressure and resolving interpersonal friction.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: The erosion of genuine interpersonal connections in the digital era.\n"
