          "content": "# PHẦN 3 — VOCABULARY B2 THEO CHỦ ĐỀ CHUẨN VSTEP (CHỦ ĐỀ 11 - 15)\n\nHệ thống từ vựng học thuật B2 được biên soạn theo chu trình:\nVocabulary (Từ loại + IPA + Nghĩa) -> Collocations -> Word Family -> Synonyms / Antonyms -> Câu ví dụ B2 -> Ứng dụng Speaking & Writing.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 11: COMMUNICATION & LANGUAGE ACQUISITION (GIAO TIẾP & THỤ ĐẮC NGÔN NGỮ)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: linguistic competence, language acquisition, bilingualism, multilingual, mother tongue, native speaker, body language, non-verbal communication, facial expression, fluency, accuracy, dialect, accent, articulate, misinterpretation, barrier, idiomatic, nuance, register, formal register, informal register, proficiency, immersion, cognitive agility, monolingual, speech impediment, discourse, eloquence, convey, gesture, decipher, communicative competence, linguistic diversity, cross-cultural, language barrier.\n- Ví dụ B2: Early immersion in multilingual educational environments decisively enhances neuroplasticity and cognitive communicative flexibility.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Refining non-verbal cues and overcoming foreign language speaking anxiety.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Preservation of minority languages versus globalization of English as a lingua franca.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 12: MASS MEDIA, JOURNALISM & ADVERTISING (TRUYỀN THÔNG & QUẢNG CÁO)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: mass media, investigative journalism, sensationalism, tabloid, broadsheet, media outlet, press freedom, censorship, objectivity, bias, commercial break, advertisement, endorsement, sponsor, billboard, consumerism, target audience, brand loyalty, misleading advertising, public relations (PR), press release, broadcast, circulation, editorial, paparazzi, media mogul, propaganda, deceptive marketing, prime time, coverage, infomercial, digital marketing, viral campaign, scrutinize, credibility.\n- Ví dụ B2: The rampant proliferation of tabloid sensationalism severely compromises journalistic integrity and distorts objective public discourse.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Influence of celebrity endorsements on consumer purchasing habits.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Mandatory state regulations on manipulative advertising targeting vulnerable children.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 13: INTERNET, CYBERSPACE & DIGITAL PRIVACY (INTERNET & QUYỀN RIÊNG TƯ SỐ)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: cyberspace, digital footprint, cyberbullying, data breach, identity theft, surveillance, encryption, phishing, malware, firewall, social media addiction, search engine, algorithmic feed, user privacy, terms of service, cyber espionage, hacker, virtual community, e-commerce, cloud storage, cookies, troll, internet censorship, digital divide, hyper-connected, bandwidth, telecommuting, biometric authentication, online harassment, netiquette, monetization, viral, unauthorized access, dark web, parental control.\n- Ví dụ B2: Indiscriminately surrendering personal data on social media leaves netizens acutely vulnerable to cyber espionage and algorithmic identity theft.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Navigating internet trolls and protecting personal privacy online.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Balancing national cybersecurity surveillance against individual civil liberties and privacy rights.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 14: SCIENCE, RESEARCH & SPACE EXPLORATION (KHOA HỌC & VŨ TRỤ)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: empirical evidence, scientific breakthrough, hypothesis, peer-reviewed, clinical trial, laboratory, genetic engineering, cloning, aerospace, astronomical, extraterrestrial, orbit, cosmos, space exploration, celestial body, astrophysics, observatory, satellite, nanotechnology, artificial gravity, quantum physics, paradigm shift, methodology, longitudinal study, telescope, spacecraft, colonize Mars, zero gravity, ethical boundary, experiment, specimen, scientific rigor, innovation, space tourism, cosmic phenomenon.\n- Ví dụ B2: A rigorous scientific paradigm shift requires reproducible empirical evidence validated through exhaustive peer-reviewed trials.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Justifying governmental expenditure on space missions versus domestic welfare.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Ethical boundaries of genetic engineering and human embryonic cloning.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 15: ECONOMY, INFLATION & PERSONAL FINANCE (KINH TẾ & TÀI CHÍNH)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: macroeconomic, microeconomic, gross domestic product (GDP), inflation rate, purchasing power, cost of living, economic recession, fiscal deficit, monetary policy, interest rate, liquidity, taxation, progressive tax, austerity measure, revenue, expenditure, mortgage, stock market, investment portfolio, asset, liability, bankruptcy, subsidy, stimulate, trade surplus, foreign direct investment (FDI), exchange rate, consumer confidence, financial literacy, savings account, debt accumulation, credit rating, wealth accumulation, economic prosperity, volatile market.\n- Ví dụ B2: Soaring inflation rates erode the purchasing power of middle-class households, triggering severe contraction in consumer confidence.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Developing personal financial literacy and budget management among university undergraduates.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Combating economic stagflation through central bank interest rate interventions and state-backed infrastructural stimuli.\n"
