          "content": "# PHẦN 3 — VOCABULARY B2 THEO CHỦ ĐỀ CHUẨN VSTEP (CHỦ ĐỀ 16 - 20)\n\nHệ thống từ vựng học thuật B2 được biên soạn theo chu trình:\nVocabulary (Từ loại + IPA + Nghĩa) -> Collocations -> Word Family -> Synonyms / Antonyms -> Câu ví dụ B2 -> Ứng dụng Speaking & Writing.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 16: BUSINESS, COMMERCE & ENTREPRENEURSHIP (DOANH NGHIỆP & KHỞI NGHIỆP)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: entrepreneurship, startup, venture capital, angel investor, business model, market share, competitive advantage, customer retention, supply chain, logistics, merger, acquisition, conglomerate, corporate social responsibility (CSR), stakeholder, shareholder, profit margin, revenue stream, niche market, saturation, feasibility study, return on investment (ROI), business incubator, blue-chip, commercial enterprise, brand equity, monopoly, diversification, consumer behavior, insolvency, ethical business, scalability, trade barrier, commerce, multinational corporation.\n- Ví dụ B2: Fostering early-stage entrepreneurship requires accessible venture capital combined with strategic mentorship in scalable business models.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Navigating risks when launching an independent startup versus working for a conglomerate.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Mandatory corporate social responsibility (CSR) programs versus purely profit-driven operations.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 17: TRANSPORTATION & URBAN MOBILITY (GIAO THÔNG ĐÔ THỊ)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: traffic congestion, gridlock, mass transit, public transportation, commuter, pedestrian, infrastructure, carpooling, cycle lane, rush hour, bottleneck, road safety, emission, carbon monoxide, electric vehicle (EV), charging station, autonomous vehicle, bypass, flyover, subway network, light rail, fare, transit-oriented development, subsidy, toll road, freight transport, logistics hub, sustainable mobility, vehicular traffic, parking deficit, transit authority, road casualty, traffic regulation, pedestrianized zone, urban mobility.\n- Ví dụ B2: Investing heavily in transit-oriented development and light rail networks represents the only viable long-term remedy for chronic urban gridlock.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Personal habits regarding public transport versus private motorbikes.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Subsidizing public mass transit versus penalizing private car owners with congestion pricing.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 18: TRAVEL, CULTURAL EXPLORATION & HERITAGE (DU LỊCH & KHÁM PHÁ)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: wanderlust, itinerary, destination, off the beaten track, cultural immersion, picturesque, breathtaking, historical landmark, ancient monument, heritage site, hospitality, local cuisine, excursion, backpacking, travel agency, souvenir, culture shock, acclimatize, guided tour, globetrotter, voyage, scenic route, picturesque landscape, architectural marvel, expedition, customs, cultural diversity, remote, exotic, travel insurance, boarding pass, accommodation, travel advisory, memorable, homestay.\n- Ví dụ B2: Traveling off the beaten track facilitates authentic cultural immersion and cultivates profound intercultural empathy.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Describing a memorable excursion to a historical landmark.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 1: Formal inquiry to a travel bureau requesting itinerary adjustments.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 19: TOURISM, MASS TOURISM & ECOTOURISM (NGÀNH DU LỊCH & SINH THÁI)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: tourism industry, mass tourism, ecotourism, overtourism, sustainable tourism, carbon footprint, ecological impact, tourist trap, commercialization, hospitality sector, revenue, local economy, cultural degradation, environmental degradation, wildlife sanctuary, carrying capacity, indigenous population, resort, travel corridor, tourist influx, seasonal employment, conservation, visitor management, ethical travel, pristine environment, destination management, tourism boom, littering, cultural erosion, travel advisory, carbon offset, preservation, local livelihood, UNESCO site, eco-friendly.\n- Ví dụ B2: Unchecked mass tourism inevitably triggers environmental degradation and erodes the cultural authenticity of indigenous heritage sites.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Balancing economic gains from tourism booms against local environmental preservation.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Implementing strict carrying capacity quotas on popular natural reserves to combat overtourism.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 20: CULTURE, TRADITIONS & PRESERVATION (VĂN HÓA & BẢO TỒN DI SẢN)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: cultural heritage, tangible heritage, intangible heritage, cultural identity, indigenous tradition, folklore, custom, ritual, festival, preservation, assimilation, cultural homogenization, ethnic diversity, historic preservation, cultural artifact, heirloom, ancestor, historical narrative, museum, globalization, cultural exchange, national identity, revitalize, safeguard, ceremonial, craftsmanship, oral tradition, UNESCO World Heritage, ancestral veneration, cultural appropriation, legacy, patriotism, monument, cultural erosion, authenticity.\n- Ví dụ B2: In an era dominated by cultural homogenization, safeguarding intangible oral traditions is paramount for preserving national identity.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Celebrating traditional Lunar New Year customs and familial rituals.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Allocating state revenue to museum restoration and historical landmark preservation versus healthcare.\n"
