          "content": "# PHẦN 3 — VOCABULARY B2 THEO CHỦ ĐỀ CHUẨN VSTEP (CHỦ ĐỀ 21 - 25)\n\nHệ thống từ vựng học thuật B2 được biên soạn theo chu trình:\nVocabulary (Từ loại + IPA + Nghĩa) -> Collocations -> Word Family -> Synonyms / Antonyms -> Câu ví dụ B2 -> Ứng dụng Speaking & Writing.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 21: ENTERTAINMENT, ARTS & CINEMA (GIẢI TRÍ, NGHỆ THUẬT & ĐIỆN ẢNH)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: performing arts, visual arts, masterpiece, cinematography, blockbuster, censorship, aesthetic value, artistic expression, commercialization, exhibition, theater production, symphony, sculpture, literary genre, protagonist, antagonist, plot twist, scriptwriter, critically acclaimed, box office, streaming platform, copyright infringement, live performance, cultural enrichment, audience engagement, creative license, entertainment industry, escapism, avant-garde, repertoire, patron of the arts, evocative, visual effects, cultivate creativity, public gallery.\n- Ví dụ B2: Public subsidies allocated to the performing arts are vital for sustaining cultural enrichment and fostering experimental avant-garde creativity.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Preference for theatrical live performances versus on-demand digital streaming platforms.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Governmental financial patronage for public art galleries and orchestras versus prioritizing healthcare.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 22: GOVERNMENT, PUBLIC POLICY & CIVIC DUTIES (CHÍNH PHỦ & CHÍNH SÁCH CÔNG)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: public administration, sovereign state, public policy, civil duty, legislative body, parliament, electorate, referendum, bureaucracy, welfare state, taxation, budget allocation, transparency, accountability, corruption, civic engagement, public expenditure, municipal council, social security, democracy, authoritarianism, constituency, policy implementation, reform, public consultation, statutory regulation, subsidize, civil servant, governance, public infrastructure, fiscal stimulus, civic responsibility, compliance, grassroots movement, state intervention.\n- Ví dụ B2: Fostering institutional transparency and bureaucratic accountability is indispensable for restoring public confidence in state governance.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Civic responsibilities of youth in community decision-making and environmental initiatives.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: State intervention in economic planning versus free-market laissez-faire mechanisms.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 23: LAW, REGULATIONS & JUSTICE SYSTEM (PHÁP LUẬT & HỆ THỐNG TƯ PHÁP)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: legislation, statutory, jurisdiction, judiciary, rule of law, constitutional, prosecutor, defendant, jury, verdict, acquit, convict, appeal, litigation, legal counsel, tribunal, enforce, adhere to, breach of contract, statute of limitations, penalty, jurisprudence, legal precedent, injunction, testimony, witness, cross-examine, impartial, plaintiff, due process, decree, civil law, criminal law, legal aid, presumption of innocence.\n- Ví dụ B2: Adherence to the rule of law and the constitutional presumption of innocence constitutes the cornerstone of any equitable justice system.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Understanding legal regulations and public order in urban spaces.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: The necessity of accessible legal aid for socioeconomically disadvantaged citizens facing corporate litigation.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 24: CRIME, CYBERCRIME & REHABILITATION (TỘI PHẠM & CẢI TẠO)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: delinquency, felony, misdemeanor, offender, recidivism, capital punishment, custodial sentence, probation, community service, rehabilitation, deter, deterrence, prison overcrowding, white-collar crime, embezzlement, fraud, cybercrime, identity theft, illicit, law enforcement, forensic science, perpetrator, homicide, burglary, juvenile detention, reintegrate into society, punitive measure, correctional facility, restorative justice, crime prevention, surveillance, victim compensation, parole, wrongful conviction, combat delinquency.\n- Ví dụ B2: Implementing comprehensive vocational rehabilitation inside correctional facilities proves substantially more effective at curtailing recidivism than imposing purely punitive sentences.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Community service versus custodial imprisonment for non-violent youth offenders.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: The efficacy of capital punishment as a crime deterrent versus restorative justice paradigms.\n\n---\n\n## CHỦ ĐỀ 25: GLOBALIZATION & INTERNATIONAL INTEGRATION (TOÀN CẦU HÓA & HỘI NHẬP)\n- 35 từ/cụm từ cốt lõi: globalization, international integration, multilateral, bilateral, trade liberalization, tariff, free trade agreement (FTA), supply chain, multinational corporation (MNC), foreign direct investment (FDI), cultural homogenization, westernization, economic interdependence, protectionism, brain drain, sovereign autonomy, borderless world, global citizenship, cross-border, labor migration, outsource, developing economy, emerging market, geopolitical, international treaty, diplomacy, cultural exchange, standardization, global governance, disparity, supply disruption, global supply network, international coalition, transnational, foreign policy.\n- Ví dụ B2: While globalization accelerates cross-border trade liberalization and technology transfer, it simultaneously heightens domestic vulnerability to global supply chain disruptions.\n- Vận dụng Speaking: Benefits and challenges of studying or working within an internationally integrated multicultural cohort.\n- Vận dụng Writing Task 2: Evaluating whether globalization promotes mutual economic prosperity or exacerbates socioeconomic disparities between nations.\n"
